@host = http://localhost:5275

### 1. Get all books
GET {{host}}/api/books
Accept: application/json

### 2. Create a book (POST)
# @name createBook
POST {{host}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Name": "The Pragmatic Programmer",
  "Price": 39.99,
  "Category": "Computers",
  "Author": "Andrew Hunt"
}

### 3. Get the new book
GET {{host}}/api/books/{{createBook.response.body.$.Id}}
Accept: application/json

### 4. Update it (PUT)
PUT {{host}}/api/books/{{createBook.response.body.$.Id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Name": "The Pragmatic Programmer",
  "Price": 29.99,
  "Category": "Computers",
  "Author": "Andrew Hunt"
}

### 5. Delete it
DELETE {{host}}/api/books/{{createBook.response.body.$.Id}}